Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:09.17,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Until I can reach the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.27,0:00:15.71,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I believe, until the next tomorrow, hey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.81,0:00:35.55,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Chasing and being chased on top of Mobius' ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:39.35,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Getting closer and facing forward, hey I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:43.45,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,It begins, it expands, this flavor that exceeds imagination
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:47.76,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I feel so good throughout my body, I will become free, oh yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:49.79,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if it's far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:51.73,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, by telling each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.76,0:00:53.60,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Share the good times and laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.45,0:01:03.74,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I'll keep going until I can reach the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.81,0:01:13.05,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Let's overcome it now, I believe in the next tomorrow yeah yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.15,0:01:21.56,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,You were waiting there on the other side of the invisible wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.66,0:01:31.62,OP11 Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I'll be there soon, I believe in one world yeah yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.76,0:01:51.27,Title,,0,0,100,,{\an8\fad(1800,900)}我什麼都救不了！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:47.14,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我聽說了一些你在這座島上的傳聞...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:50.00,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,所以是真的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.26,0:01:52.88,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,看你幫了這些小鬼，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.98,0:01:55.86,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,這把年紀了還是海賊嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:57.52,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,雷利先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:02:01.82,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,如果你們願意撤銷我的懸賞令...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.06,0:02:05.60,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,我也能安心退休了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:08.44,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,海賊的罪行不會消失吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:10.84,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,尤其是羅傑海賊團的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.42,0:02:14.08,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,不過如果我們要抓你的話，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.20,0:02:18.24,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,需要比現在更充分的準備才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.43,0:02:23.44,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,太好了索隆！這個老頭果然很厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.92,0:02:26.94,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,不管我刺多少次都刺不穿的身體...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:30.18,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,他一下就擋住了！怎麼做到的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:35.24,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,你不能讓他們走吧，黃猿君？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.62,0:02:38.04,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,饒了我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:40.80,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,如果我們連這些小鬼都抓不住...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.92,0:02:47.62,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,那我們海軍本部就沒臉面對瑪麗喬亞的天龍人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:49.88,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,可以請你讓開嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.14,0:02:52.65,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,騙人布！布魯克！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:56.21,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,帶著索隆快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:02:57.28,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:59.02,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,走吧布魯克！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:03.38,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,所有人只管想著怎麼逃跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.63,0:03:05.94,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,現在的我們...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:07.80,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,打不過...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:10.06,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,這些傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.74,0:03:14.30,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,噢，真是煩人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:15.72,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:18.52,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我要用掉所有的可樂能量...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:20.62,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這是我最後一擊了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.36,0:03:23.64,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}風來噴射！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.78,0:03:30.00,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那個該死的白痴肯定感覺到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:30.98,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:34.94,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,老爺子，謝謝你！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.30,0:03:37.12,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,沒事！祈禱你們平安！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.34,0:03:40.32,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}八咫鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:45.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:48.16,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,光！他在搞什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:54.12,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,我不會讓你過去的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:56.84,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,好久沒用劍了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.46,0:03:59.46,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}天叢雲劍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:07.24,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我可真是為難啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:11.32,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,我本來以為來這座島會很輕鬆的...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:15.14,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,煩惱也是人生的一部分啊，黃猿君。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:18.10,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,前方的光消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.26,0:04:20.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,看來老頭又救了我們一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:22.34,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,好、好、好可怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:28.62,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,他果然是真正的冥王。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.90,0:04:32.14,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,這是我第一次看到有人擋住老頭。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:35.78,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,但我們就差一步就能抓到懸賞金超過一億的羅羅亞了...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:39.92,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,PX-1！羅羅亞已經半死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:41.20,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,去解決他！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:53.82,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.10,0:04:54.84,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:58.08,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,照顧好娜美桑！你們先走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:00.82,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,小心！我們會沒事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:02.16,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,香吉士君？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.50,0:05:04.52,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他衝著騙人布他們去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:09.60,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,放我下來...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.98,0:05:14.56,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,讓我留下來掩護你們逃...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:19.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別說傻話了！你現在比我還沒用！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.52,0:05:20.88,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我們一起跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.28,0:05:23.10,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這是魯夫要我們做的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.36,0:05:26.14,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,難道是...？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:30.18,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:36.08,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,騙人布先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:40.20,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,騙人布先生，你先走！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:42.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,住手布魯克！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:44.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你知道他有多強的吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.66,0:05:45.44,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:48.80,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,人人為我，我為人人！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:52.76,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,男人有些時候不得不挺身而出！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:02.04,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,碎骨性的慘敗...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.80,0:06:04.40,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,布魯克！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:10.02,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:12.78,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,給我站住，你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:21.44,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:23.90,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我的腿...！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.34,0:06:28.66,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,快跑，香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:30.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他在瞄你！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:33.78,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,笨蛋！快點走啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:48.34,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,如你所見，我的部下就已經夠強了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:59.66,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,索隆，對不起！我把你摔了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:00.68,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.39,0:07:06.01,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那邊有麻煩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:08.23,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,連大斧頭都不需要用了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.73,0:07:13.11,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我都說了你沒空擔心夥伴！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:15.77,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}足鎖·吆嗨嗨！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.79,0:07:20.01,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:23.57,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,那傢伙的攻擊怎麼能傷到橡膠人魯夫？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:24.63,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:26.75,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,喬巴！別停下！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:28.67,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.59,0:07:36.15,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:51.00,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,可惡！大家都要被殺了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:54.19,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,不行喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.39,0:07:57.91,Main,Choopper,0,0,0,,住手，你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.07,0:07:59.61,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}藍波球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:09.97,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:12.27,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那是上次那個狀態！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:14.95,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:20.73,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我聽說過...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.47,0:08:30.51,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,有趣的能力，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:33.59,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你好像失去理智了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:37.60,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,魯夫，小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:53.79,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那個喬巴... 他又那樣了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:04.66,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不知道為什麼，他好像被那個吸引了注意力...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.91,0:09:05.93,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在是機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:09.53,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,香吉士、布魯克！起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.69,0:09:12.51,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,趁現在趕快逃離這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:14.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他又要發射光束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:20.43,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，快叫醒布魯克！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:21.33,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:28.22,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,等等，PX-1。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.59,0:09:42.65,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,又出現一個！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.89,0:09:46.43,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.76,0:09:48.27,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:52.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這些傢伙到底有幾個啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:03.33,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,這個傢伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:06.09,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,...是真的那個！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.68,0:10:12.63,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,原來你活下來了嗎，羅羅亞？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.32,0:10:17.51,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,多虧了你的慈悲...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:19.29,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂... 喂，索隆...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:21.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在不是說話的時候...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.69,0:10:22.29,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.55,0:10:27.99,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,如果你要去度假的話，你想去哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.35,0:10:31.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂，索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:34.13,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果你再不趕快逃的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:40.05,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:10:59.31,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,索、索隆...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.38,0:11:10.04,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:11.90,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你對索隆做了什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:13.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他明明...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.76,0:11:15.02,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他剛才明明...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.02,0:11:17.44,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,...就在這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:26.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆...？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:29.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索、索隆？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:32.21,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:34.10,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:39.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:52.15,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,住手喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.04,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,別衝動！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.18,0:11:59.08,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆... 你去哪了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:12.28,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,他已經失去控制了...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:14.50,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,不管怎樣，那個熊小子...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:17.46,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,那傢伙在這裡搞什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:25.46,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,乂索隆熊...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:31.16,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,這就是為什麼海賊不能信任！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:34.82,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,那邊也被包圍了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:39.04,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,索隆突然消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:42.32,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,難道說真正的那個終於出現了？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.44,0:12:43.98,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,沒錯...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:46.80,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,我之前看過那個能力...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:50.12,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,在Thriller Bark的時候他用那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:51.94,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,...把一個女孩弄消失了...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.02,0:12:53.96,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,...然後她就再也沒回來！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:04.72,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這下真的完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.59,0:13:08.08,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！他對索隆做了什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:09.64,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,他消失去哪裡了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.09,0:13:12.03,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我沒有義務回答。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.61,0:13:15.44,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,我是世界上最守口如瓶的男人。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:19.05,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,不知道是不是真的，但聽說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:20.91,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,被他的肉球彈飛的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:23.60,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,會在天上飛三天三夜...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:27.75,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,除了被彈飛的人以外沒人知道去了哪裡...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.37,0:13:30.29,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,但肯定不會是在這座島上...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:33.56,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,也不會是你短時間內能碰到他們的任何地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:36.45,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,他們可能會落到某個遙遠海域的盡頭。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.72,0:13:37.38,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:48.54,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,說話啊你這該死的怪胎！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:51.27,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你把索隆送去哪了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:54.51,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,看來他終於出現了...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.63,0:13:55.89,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,真正的七武海...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:58.77,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,有三個長一樣的...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.18,0:14:00.24,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,到底怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.73,0:14:02.63,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,真... 真正的七武海...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.42,0:14:09.36,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別再靠近了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.23,0:14:12.11,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡... 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:16.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我可是有8000個手下的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.82,0:14:18.97,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喂！聽不到嗎？！別再靠近了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:21.38,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,小心騙人布！後面！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.10,0:14:22.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,後——？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.18,0:14:32.57,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,不要插手。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:42.71,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,他連自己的同伴都排除了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:49.67,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,連PX-1也？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:52.97,Main,Sentoumaru,0,0,0,,你在搞什麼啊跟你的同伴，熊小子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.11,0:14:58.45,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們三個快跑！！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:14:59.69,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:01.78,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,大家快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:04.63,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,等到安全了再想辦法！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:07.47,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,快走！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:14.45,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,喂，走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.67,0:15:16.05,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,可是... 索隆...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:19.12,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他說了等安全了再想！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:19.97,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.59,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,走！光束只是擦到了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.67,0:15:26.03,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我借你肩膀，快！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:29.47,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,你們兩個小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.85,0:15:30.69,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,布魯克！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.31,0:15:32.37,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,布魯克！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:39.21,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我會保護你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.59,0:15:41.91,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,就算賭上我的性命！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.34,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,...雖然我已經死——
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:48.19,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,布魯克！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.52,0:15:57.69,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,可惡... 我在幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:16:00.77,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,兩個夥伴就在我眼前消失了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.92,0:16:02.76,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:04.63,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,快走騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:08.19,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別說傻話了！我們一起走，香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.38,0:16:09.33,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你...！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:12.43,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,住手香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:16.27,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,肉球混蛋！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:26.53,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:38.15,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別靠近！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:42.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別靠近！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.78,0:16:43.47,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別靠近！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:44.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火藥星！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:45.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火藥星！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:47.78,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.12,0:16:49.06,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火藥星！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:50.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火藥星！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.14,0:16:52.20,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火藥星！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:16:53.46,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火藥星！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:57.14,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:00.08,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,快跑！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.16,0:17:01.54,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,快跑！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.98,0:17:12.50,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:15.06,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,香吉士？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:20.48,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,該死！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:24.24,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,住手香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.46,0:17:33.74,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,連香吉士也...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:35.14,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,怎麼回事...？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:36.36,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們該怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.78,0:17:38.80,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:40.06,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,大家都...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.94,0:17:49.82,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,那邊的情況看起來沒希望了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:54.92,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,我想幫他們，但我老了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.50,0:17:59.72,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你一個人擋著海軍大將\N還想做更多嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.98,0:18:04.92,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你讓我太丟臉了，別這樣了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.40,0:18:15.12,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,你就是「冥王」雷利吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:15.66,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:20.96,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,熊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:30.66,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,魯夫？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.58,0:18:35.96,Main,Rayleigh,0,0,0,,你真的要我相信你剛才說的話？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:38.28,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,你自己判斷吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:41.40,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,我已經在危及自己的立場了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:47.06,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你到底打算做什麼，熊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:50.74,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,只要不直接影響到世界政府...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:54.16,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,我們沒有義務跟海軍配合。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:56.60,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,那個問題我不會回答。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:18:58.68,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:02.41,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二檔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:10.14,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,給我讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:12.52,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}強力右拳！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:15.14,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:20.42,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.62,0:19:21.64,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,不行魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:23.48,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.86,0:19:27.00,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}噴射手槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:37.34,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,不！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.34,0:19:47.08,Main,Nami,0,0,0,,魯夫！救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:50.74,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,娜美！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.02,0:20:20.80,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.34,0:20:30.42,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,喬巴...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:42.42,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喬巴！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:57.98,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喬巴...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:04.20,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,住手...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.48,0:21:06.36,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,住手...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:08.36,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,住手...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.66,0:21:13.32,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,拜託你，住手！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.74,0:21:16.46,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.54,0:21:20.00,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,羅賓！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.10,0:21:21.64,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,魯夫！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.70,0:22:14.96,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,我連一個...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.52,0:22:17.34,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,...夥伴都救不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:28.38,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你就這樣把他送走就結束了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.52,0:22:36.02,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,你最好有個合理的解釋。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:40.12,Main,Kizaru,0,0,0,,這可是個大問題，你知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:51.40,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,我們再也...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.94,0:22:53.80,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,...不會見面了。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.08,0:23:04.58,Main,Kuma,0,0,0,,永別了。
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:21.30,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,150)}偉大航道...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.58,0:23:23.30,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}夏波帝諸島...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.58,0:23:25.56,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)}12號紅樹林...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:28.08,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}在這一天...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:31.49,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...由船長蒙其·D·魯夫率領的海賊團...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.84,0:23:33.61,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}...草帽海賊團...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.76,0:23:39.96,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}...全軍覆沒。

